{
    "title": "Super.com - Save, Earn, Travel",
    "description": "\"Super.com (previously Snaptravel) is the all-in-one app that puts more money in your pocket! Save big on hotels, access a cash advance, get cash back on purchases, boost your credit score, earn money playing games, and more. Super+ members unlock even greater savings and earnings. Get the super.com app and make every day Super!\r\n\r\nRECEIVE CASH ADVANCES UP TO $250\r\nNeed cash now? No problem. Get a cash advance up to $250 right\u2028from the app. No credit check and no interest to repay.\r\n\r\nEARN UP TO $430 - PLAY GAMES, TAKE PAID SURVEYS \r\nSupplement your income through games, surveys, missions, and more. Some members are saving and earning over $400/month!\r\n\r\nSAVE UP TO 50% ON ALL YOUR HOTEL BOOKINGS\r\nPlus get an extra 10% cashback when you sign up for a Super+ membership.\r\n\r\nLOVED AND TRUSTED BY OVER 20 MILLION USERS\r\n4.3 on the Play Store / 4.1 score on BBB \r\n\r\n\u201cThe Super Card has unlimited cashback on all purchases and doesn\u2019t require a credit check or minimum balance! What\u2019s not to love?\u201d\r\n-Farrah F.\r\n\r\n\u201cI\u2019ve earned close to $300 in less than two weeks with super.com.\u201d\r\n-Brandon D.\r\n\r\n\u201cSuper.com is by far the best. I don\u2019t think any other site offers the same amazing rates.\u201d\r\n-Serli H.\r\n\r\nSTAY UP TO DATE WITH ALL OUR LATEST NEWS\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/savewithsuper\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@savewithsuper\r\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@super\r\nBlog: https://www.super.com/blog\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "&quot;Super.com (previously Snaptravel) is the all-in-one app that puts more money in your pocket! Save big on hotels, access a cash advance, get cash back on purchases, boost your credit score, earn money playing games, and more. Super+ members unlock even greater savings and earnings. Get the super.com app and make every day Super!<br><br>RECEIVE CASH ADVANCES UP TO $250<br>Need cash now? No problem. Get a cash advance up to $250 right\u2028from the app. No credit check and no interest to repay.<br><br>EARN UP TO $430 - PLAY GAMES, TAKE PAID SURVEYS <br>Supplement your income through games, surveys, missions, and more. Some members are saving and earning over $400/month!<br><br>SAVE UP TO 50% ON ALL YOUR HOTEL BOOKINGS<br>Plus get an extra 10% cashback when you sign up for a Super+ membership.<br><br>LOVED AND TRUSTED BY OVER 20 MILLION USERS<br>4.3 on the Play Store / 4.1 score on BBB <br><br>\u201cThe Super Card has unlimited cashback on all purchases and doesn\u2019t require a credit check or minimum balance! What\u2019s not to love?\u201d<br>-Farrah F.<br><br>\u201cI\u2019ve earned close to $300 in less than two weeks with super.com.\u201d<br>-Brandon D.<br><br>\u201cSuper.com is by far the best. I don\u2019t think any other site offers the same amazing rates.\u201d<br>-Serli H.<br><br>STAY UP TO DATE WITH ALL OUR LATEST NEWS<br>Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/savewithsuper<br>YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@savewithsuper<br>TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@super<br>Blog: https://www.super.com/blog&quot;",
